            <h1>
            <p> We are all trying to improve based on feedback. Yet sometimes that very reason others quit. Criticism can be insulting if you do not take in to account emotion; especially when many artists in today's world are bashed and dismissed on social media and the web. Whether you are anonymous or not, criticizing a creator on the web can hurt them. It's been shown many times through history that this has been the primary reason for failed dreams and pain. If you take a second to think about their emotions and their effort before messaging, <div>it can change EVERTHING.</div></p>
